{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10640080","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10640080","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"narration:0:1064008001:0":{"text":"After a painstaking search, you finally get your hands on some concentrated elemental essence.","source_cn":"经历了费时的寻找，你们成功收集到了浓郁的元素精华。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x3105C1B6B99C96E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:1:1064008002:0":{"text":"You head back to the mine and find Zanie waiting, a large pot of bubbling gray liquid in front of her.","source_cn":"随后，你们返回了矿洞里，祖娅已经在此等候。而她的面前正...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1064008003:1":{"text":"You guys made it just in time!","source_cn":"你们回来的正好！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x88D9A03E29CF4F06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1064008004:1":{"text":"The soup is ready!","source_cn":"快来尝尝晶化伞菇浓汤！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x642F324E80BCC747","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:4::2":{"text":"Crystallized Mushroom Soup","source_cn":"晶化伞菇浓汤","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47B130493054B7F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1064008004":{"text":"The soup is ready!","source_cn":"快来尝尝晶化伞菇浓汤！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x642F324E80BCC747","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1064008005:1":{"text":"Absolutely! I made the soup with nightshards, the fungus on the heads of hopping mushroom sprites, along with some flour and goat's milk.","source_cn":"肯定能啊！原料是暗烬晶体、蹦蹦菇灵头上的小伞菌、面粉和羊奶。","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xCCC9867F3C4BD0B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1064008006:1":{"text":"No weird stuff, I promise!","source_cn":"多正常啊！都是能吃的东西！","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x99198ECA458F3202","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064008007:1":{"text":"Aside from flour and goat's milk, the other two are also \"ordinary\"...?","source_cn":"面粉和羊奶以外的另两个也算普通吗……？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x5D45B6C4CF56CBC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1064008008:1":{"text":"Having \"edible\" as the only standard seems questionable...","source_cn":"判断标准竟然是能不能吃吗……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x5954F047B5E17A62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1064008009:1":{"text":"You're right. When it comes to mushrooms, we shouldn't throw caution to the wind.","source_cn":"老夫也这么觉得，菌菇类食用起来需要格外小心。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x2F3E1F1F7099B3F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064008010:0":{"text":"The color of this mushroom cap doesn't reassure me...","source_cn":"这个菌伞的颜色看起来……不太妙啊。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xB2F4DA770F35EF90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1064008011:0":{"text":"I'm surprised you caught that... The recipe mentioned fuzzy mushrooms, but I thought I'd add my own twist, so...","source_cn":"竟然被发现了……食谱上写的是茸茸伞菇，但我灵机一动——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xBB1922501ED51166","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1064008012:0":{"text":"I used the fungus from hopping mushroom sprites instead! S-Since they're both mushrooms, there shouldn't be any problems, right...","source_cn":"换成了蹦蹦菇灵头上的小伞菌。反正、反正都是蘑菇，差不多...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:18:1064008012":{"text":"I used the fungus from hopping mushroom sprites instead! S-Since they're both mushrooms, there shouldn't be any problems, right...","source_cn":"换成了蹦蹦菇灵头上的小伞菌。反正、反正都是蘑菇，差不多的吧……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x3BFF5848CC191C56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1064008013:1":{"text":"As I just said, the surprises are worth the risk!","source_cn":"不不不，都说了冒险才有惊喜。","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xA602E816A3DDFACD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1064008014:0":{"text":"Is the hopping mushroom sprite a type of monster?","source_cn":"蹦蹦菇灵是蘑菇怪吗？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x11FC265A2F886DD4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1064008015:1":{"text":"Is it like a Walking Mushroom?","source_cn":"听起来有点像行走菇呢。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x69C98F1FE782CE92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1064008016:1":{"text":"Doesn't look like it...","source_cn":"我不这么觉得……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x91058339E850AF75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1064008017:1":{"text":"Zanie, I'd like a bowl of the soup, please.","source_cn":"祖娅，请给我盛一碗。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x313FE032FDB5274D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1064008018:1":{"text":"I'm with you—people should always keep their spirit of curiosity alive!","source_cn":"我非常认同你的观点，冒险精神是必不可少的东西！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x10F7176D509DF699","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1064008019:1":{"text":"Y-You could think it over a little more, you know...","source_cn":"倒、倒也不必这么坚定……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x56D5D195CB872178","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1064008020:1":{"text":"A-Anyway, thanks for supporting me...","source_cn":"但、但还是谢谢你赏脸……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xE4F7F2F644EFD8F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1064008021:1":{"text":"Though everyone else is skeptical, Laios takes the bowl from Zanie and downs more than half the soup in one go.","source_cn":"莱欧斯不顾你们的质疑，接过祖娅递来的碗，一口气喝下了大...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1064008022:1":{"text":"All of you hold your breath, nervously watching his reaction.","source_cn":"你们在一旁屏住呼吸，紧张地观察着他的反应。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xD81DC5ECE764E33F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1064008023:0":{"text":"Mmm... There's a distinct mineral-like flavor, and the texture of the soup is incredibly smooth.","source_cn":"唔……有种奇特的矿物质味道，质地很顺滑。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xCF7FC2B3EE3D6144","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1064008024:0":{"text":"And the smell of the mushroom... I can see a hopping mushroom sprite jumping right in front of me...","source_cn":"又有菌菇的香气，好像能看到蹦蹦菇灵在我面前跳动……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x611D9A61DE9FB423","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1064008025:1":{"text":"Hey! You're not hallucinating, are you?","source_cn":"喂！你该不会产生幻觉了吧？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x47C8952B45CC6962","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1064008026:0":{"text":"Laios? Are you alright?","source_cn":"莱欧斯？你没事吧？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x89518F329482AA61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1064008027:1":{"text":"Ah, the mushroom sprite is telling me to go that way—aghhh...","source_cn":"啊，蹦蹦菇灵说要往那边去——呕呕呕呕呕……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x7404315DD9D8BAB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1064008028:0":{"text":"Laios stumbles over to a pillar and starts throwing up.","source_cn":"莱欧斯跌跌撞撞地跑向了远处，扶着矿柱狂吐了起来。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x1D5577FF2850DED8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1064008029:0":{"text":"As the sound of him vomiting echoes through the mine, an air of awkwardness fills the space...","source_cn":"回声在矿洞中反复回荡，场面更尴尬了……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xCB860B98136E5CEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1064008030:1":{"text":"Um... I think my experiment has failed...","source_cn":"呃……看来，实验失败了……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF133BB8626273C4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1064008031:1":{"text":"I should have tried the soup myself first! So sorry!","source_cn":"对不起！我太草率了！我应该先自己品尝的！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x39E2965233992003","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1064008032:1":{"text":"Zanie, how could you not even try it yourself?!","source_cn":"祖娅，你自己竟然都没尝过！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x9C01D9C96DEC1017","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1064008033:1":{"text":"I got carried away... Let me make it up to you with this turkey roll!","source_cn":"我得意忘形了……作为赔罪，我请大家吃这个锻炉火鸡卷！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x156927987A93413E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:52::2":{"text":"Turkey Roll","source_cn":"锻炉火鸡卷","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x918767B17DA9C193","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1064008034:1":{"text":"Did you make this too?","source_cn":"这不会也是你做的吧？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xC64ADCD840A194A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1064008035:0":{"text":"Don't worry, I bought it from Gwenna in the village! It's 100% safe to eat!","source_cn":"放心，这是村里葛文娜大娘做的，安全无毒！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x69F06E695A0CA4E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1064008036:1":{"text":"...I'll take a bite first!","source_cn":"……我先吃一口！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x27E183B89150B922","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1064008037:1":{"text":"See? No problem at all!","source_cn":"瞧！完全没问题！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xC40BA11154AA0116","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:61:1064008038:1":{"text":"You share the turkey roll with complicated feelings.","source_cn":"你们在莱欧斯的呕吐伴奏声中，面色复杂地分食了锻炉火鸡卷。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xC07C256906E94491","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:63:1064008039:0":{"text":"The turkey roll is delicious, but Laios' retching in the background really kills your appetite.","source_cn":"味道确实不错，只是背景音乐让人胃口大减。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x46509D9E63E8A11E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:64:1064008040:1":{"text":"Surprisingly, Laios doesn't take long to rejoin the group...","source_cn":"令人意外的是，莱欧斯很快回来了……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x3DA89EF0B4932C66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:66:1064008041:1":{"text":"I'm alright! I was unwell earlier, but now I feel better than ever!","source_cn":"我没事了！虽然刚才有点不舒服，但现在感觉特别好！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xC1F137421D17B1DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:67:1064008042:1":{"text":"Let's prepare the Summoner's Stew right away! I can't wait any longer!","source_cn":"我们快去做最后的黑暗召唤锅吧，我已经等不及了！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x655C9092C6B2813B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:69:1064008043:1":{"text":"Are you sure you've had enough rest?","source_cn":"你确定吗？要不要再休息一下？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF8DBF9369912E1FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:70:1064008044:1":{"text":"Yes! Don't forget, Falin's still waiting for us. Let's move!","source_cn":"不用不用，法琳还在等我们！快走吧！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x38DF8F6F1087B4D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:71:1064008044":{"text":"Yes! Don't forget, Falin's still waiting for us. Let's move!","source_cn":"不用不用，法琳还在等我们！快走吧！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x38DF8F6F1087B4D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:73:1064008045:1":{"text":"...This might be a side effect of the soup.","source_cn":"……搞不好是浓汤的副作用。","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xAC6E754928D29BAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:74:1064008046:1":{"text":"...It's possible.","source_cn":"……很有道理。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x6923B88EFC8CC41C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:75:1064008047:1":{"text":"With Laios constantly pushing for an early departure, you say your goodbyes to Zanie, who still feels sorry for the mishap.","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:76:1064008048:1":{"text":"Now, all four ingredients are ready.","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"nar